      "name": "Season 3",
      "overview": "After two seasons filled with magic and adventure, Gus the Itsy-Bitsy Knight is back for a new batch of stories that promise to be as epic as they are hilarious! Alongside his magician sister Iris and his best friend Tyler, Gus is ready to face any threat looming over the Kingdom of Karamel.\n\nIn these new adventures—riding his brand-new electric pony—Gus will meet two new arrivals in the kingdom, and not just any newcomers! Enter Prince Jak (son of King Excelsior and Queen Emeralda of the Kingdom of Moonstone) and his cousin Kaina, a proud member of the Cloud Knights. Both hail from the Valley of a Thousand Clouds, a land where steam is ingeniously harnessed as the main resource. Their mission: fight magic, which they view as a harmful force, under the guidance of Emeralda, who also happens to be the Grand Cloud Knight.\n\nOne thing’s for sure: sparks are going to fly! So, will they become friends—or enemies?",
